    "background_story": "Roselyn grew up watching her father work on electrical projects in their garage. Fascinated by the way he brought light and power to their home, she became determined to follow in his footsteps. After completing her apprenticeship, Roselyn became a licensed electrician, specializing in sustainable energy solutions. She started her own business, wiring homes and businesses for solar panels and energy-efficient systems. Roselyn's attention to detail and passion for her work earned her a reputation as one of the top electricians in the city. She was particularly proud of her work on a local community center, where she installed a state-of-the-art solar panel system, reducing their energy costs and carbon footprint. Roselyn's dedication to her craft and commitment to making a positive impact on her community made her a respected and sought-after electrician.",
